'''Immodest Modesty''' (ふんどし祭, ''Fundoshi Matsuri'', '''Loincloth Festival''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after reaching [[User Rank]] 1450.

==Effect==
Worker Cat Max UP (Sm): Wallet size is increased by 10%.

